(## Formato interno de cortes \(borrador\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (```json) Tj
T* ({) Tj
T* (  "sequenceName": "CorteIA - Reel - 2026-08-19",) Tj
T* (  "profile": "reel",) Tj
T* (  "language": "es",) Tj
T* (  "cuts": [) Tj
